WEBVTT

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:32.064
While the market
can be an extraordinary resource

00:02:32.106 --> 00:02:35.401
to get the things you need to get
to be who you want to be,

00:02:35.443 --> 00:02:37.445
for many, it's the opposite.

00:02:37.445 --> 00:02:38.821
It’s a source of un-freedom.

00:02:38.821 --> 00:02:40.198
It's a constraint.

00:02:40.239 --> 00:02:42.700
It's more akin to a system of rationing

00:02:42.742 --> 00:02:44.952
than of prosperity.

00:02:47.747 --> 00:02:51.626
We know this is the case
for an increasing number of people,

00:02:51.667 --> 00:02:53.753
because the numbers don't lie.

00:02:53.753 --> 00:02:59.175
In 2018, 40 million Americans
used food stamps --

00:02:59.217 --> 00:03:03.095
13 million more than in 2007,
before the global financial crisis.